{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>美國總統特朗普周日（8日）表示，下周往中國出席亞太經合組織（APEC）會議期間，相信會與中國國家主席習近平以及俄羅斯總統普京會面。特朗普向記者形容，屆時的會晤將涉及削減核武、結束伊朗戰事等多項議題。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.447674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T02:33:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:57:29.097060+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:40.478599+00:00","content_hash":"779dfcdb11779a5e83658570a34d74c58a96ae73ec58068e37a00db0e6c917b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}